@startuml
title D-09 Operator Console Governance Boundary
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 220

actor "Site Operator" as Operator
actor "Supervisor" as Supervisor
actor "Compliance Auditor" as Auditor
actor "Technical Support" as Support

component "Operator Console\nnon-payment governance boundary" as Console
component "Central PMS\ncontrol state authority" as Central
component "Discount Workflow\nvalidation authority" as Discount
component "Evidence References\nprivacy controlled" as Evidence
component "Continuity Workflow\nactivation / review" as Continuity
component "POS Fiscal Exception Context\nfrom Site POS Server" as Fiscal
component "Manual Release Governance\nlast-resort review" as Manual
component "Connector Health / Projection Freshness\nvisibility only" as Health
component "Audit / Event Records\nnon-repudiation" as Audit

Operator --> Console : session lookup / operational review
Supervisor --> Console : governed approvals where policy allows
Auditor --> Console : evidence and audit review
Support --> Console : technical visibility

Console --> Central : read context / submit governance decisions
Console --> Discount : review statutory evidence
Console --> Evidence : controlled evidence access
Console --> Continuity : activation/deactivation governance
Console --> Fiscal : fiscal exception review
Console --> Manual : manual release governance
Console --> Health : connector and freshness visibility
Console --> Audit : audit all governance activity

note right of Console
Operator Console does not collect payment,
issue Sales Invoices, declare finality,
issue ExitAuthorization, or directly open gates.
end note

note bottom of Manual
Manual release is last resort:
incident-tagged, audit-tagged,
reconciliation-tagged, and post-reviewed.
end note
@enduml
